{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00104",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 5.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Hmm, sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.19,
      "end_seconds": 9.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.78,
      "end_seconds": 18.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling anxious most of the day, doctor. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.16,
      "end_seconds": 23.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "How long have you had it? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.32,
      "end_seconds": 27.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "It's, It's been going on for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.84,
      "end_seconds": 31.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "So, is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.19,
      "end_seconds": 47.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "It's worse with crowded places. And, And a tight feeling in the chest as well, since last night. About tight feeling in the chest, it's every other day. Oh, and my heart pounding suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.18,
      "end_seconds": 51.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.49,
      "end_seconds": 62.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Right, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.7,
      "end_seconds": 67.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Any alcohol use, thoughts of harming myself or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.7,
      "end_seconds": 71.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.32,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.84,
      "end_seconds": 78.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.5,
      "end_seconds": 97.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.92,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.25,
      "end_seconds": 102.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.55,
      "end_seconds": 106.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.69,
      "end_seconds": 111.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.91,
      "end_seconds": 112.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.99,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.27,
      "end_seconds": 118.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.69,
      "end_seconds": 120.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.58,
      "end_seconds": 138.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.79,
      "end_seconds": 141.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.48,
      "end_seconds": 145.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "So, has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.2,
      "end_seconds": 162.65,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.09,
      "end_seconds": 166.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.2,
      "end_seconds": 168.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.15,
      "end_seconds": 172.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.56,
      "end_seconds": 179.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.68,
      "end_seconds": 183.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.53,
      "end_seconds": 189.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.73,
      "end_seconds": 194.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.22,
      "end_seconds": 203.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.31,
      "end_seconds": 207.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.81,
      "end_seconds": 212.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.95,
      "end_seconds": 225.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.4,
      "end_seconds": 229.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.95,
      "end_seconds": 237.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.59,
      "end_seconds": 253.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 79, blood pressure 121 over 69, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.23,
      "end_seconds": 255.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.01,
      "end_seconds": 258.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.52,
      "end_seconds": 263.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.57,
      "end_seconds": 265.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.28,
      "end_seconds": 281.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.9,
      "end_seconds": 284.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.06,
      "end_seconds": 288.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.02,
      "end_seconds": 305.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Pulse is regular and you're breathing comfortably right now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.88,
      "end_seconds": 312.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.13,
      "end_seconds": 316.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.29,
      "end_seconds": 317.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.23,
      "end_seconds": 335.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with an anxiety disorder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.48,
      "end_seconds": 339.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.54,
      "end_seconds": 359.09,
      "duration_seconds": 18.55,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an anxiety disorder is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling anxious most of the day for six months, and no thoughts of harming myself or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.25,
      "end_seconds": 361.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.73,
      "end_seconds": 377.1,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.43,
      "end_seconds": 380.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Um, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.19,
      "end_seconds": 402.85,
      "duration_seconds": 21.66,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for anxiety. Regular exercise and less caffeine make a real difference. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'll also refer you to a counsellor. If you have thoughts of harming yourself, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.24,
      "end_seconds": 403.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.75,
      "end_seconds": 412.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 412.59,
      "end_seconds": 416.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.07,
      "end_seconds": 421.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.85,
      "end_seconds": 424.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}